  (cf. [hypD] Lemma Ω; [pcest] §1 "Preprocessing").
- Cost L^{a+o(1)}. Consumed by Theorem S′ (the factor 2^{−ω}), by Lemma 8.5′/FM ((N, t) = 1), by
  coprimality (1.1), and by DD (μ₂(Z/N) ≅ {±1}^ω for odd N, repeated prime factors allowed).

